    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">2. Systematic room‑by‑room packing</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Packing crews arrive on the agreed date, equipped with graded boxes, bubble wrap, packing paper, and protective padding. They follow a logical sequence:

    Each box is clearly labeled with room, contents, and handling instructions (e.g., “Fragile – Keep Upright”). A master inventory sheet is updated in real time.</p>
